$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=vebklem5  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for vebkz: the shifted character sum Phi ( I , h ) equals phi ( N ) [ h == 1 ] prod_{k e. I} G k whenever no nonempty subset of I has h times its F-product congruent to 1 mod N. Induction on the finite set I.

